msgstr "De funksje %1$s stiet oan foar %2$s bûten de ynstellingen dy't Minn Admin bewurket (troch it tema, in plugin of in oanpast supports-fjild), dus hy kin hjir net útset wurde."

#. translators: 1: a post type feature, such as excerpt, 2: a post type's name.
#: includes/class-minn-admin-cpt.php:1024
